      "text": "# Spectral and Random Graph Methods — The Linear-Algebra Escape Hatch"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SPECTRAL-AND-RANDOM.md#001",
      "path": [
        "08-SPECTRAL-AND-RANDOM.md"
